The box does NOT cleanly own a single mode across 2-4 lb: its mode CROSSES the fundamental near 2-2.5 lb (box KE-in-mode-1 jumps 0.232->0.245) and its energy otherwise smears across a veering 17-45 Hz shield cluster (no single clean peak). f1 stays monotone in box mass (interlacing) but shifts only ~0.8 Hz across the whole prior and is partly confounded with valve mass. => the tap test resolves box mass only WEAKLY from f1; the next card should use the 17-45 Hz cluster (and ideally a sensor ON the box) to update it, and expect box-mass vs valve-mass confounding.
